  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing Server Components**\n\nOkay, I\'ve started putting together `server.ts`. The initial server setup is running on port 3000, listening on `0.0.0.0`. I\'m working on integrating Vite middleware for development and the static serving for production environments. Next, I\'ll focus on defining the API endpoints.\n\n\n**Defining API Endpoints**\n\nNow, I\'m defining the API endpoints. I have `/api/health` returning crucial status information, and the `/api/oracle/audit` endpoint, which is the core, handles the Gemini Multimodal API call. The `/api/oracle/sample-docs` will provide test documents, simplifying testing. The audit endpoint will validate invoice details and return results based on a structured schema, including scores, risk tiers, and cryptographic signatures.\n\n\n"
