  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing Macro View**\n\nI\'m now diving into the development of the `src/components/OverviewView.tsx` component, the Macro Overview & Analytics view. My current focus is on defining the core display elements. I\'m leaning toward an asymmetric mathematical grid to organize the presentation of protocol metrics, starting with the total tokenized volume. This approach should offer a clear, at-a-glance understanding of key data.\n\n\n**Analyzing Key Metrics**\n\nI\'ve shifted my attention to key protocol metrics for the OverviewView. I\'m focusing on incorporating data points like eINR, active financing, tranche yields (11.5% and 24.0% APY), and the insurance reserve, which provides a buffer. I\'m also grappling with how best to visually represent the default rate (0.42%) and the significant reduction in payment delays for MSMEs. The system flow visualization is also proving useful. I plan to incorporate an interactive calculator as well.\n\n\n"
