  planner_response {
    response: "I have implemented **Credexa**, a decentralized invoice discounting and supply chain financing protocol on Solana designed to resolve the 90\342\200\223120 day enterprise payment delay crisis for Indian MSMEs.\n\n### Architecture & Functional Scope\n\n- **Solana Smart Contract Architecture (Anchor Framework)**:\n  - **Invoice Tokenization (`tokenize_invoice`)**: Mints verified receivables as SPL Token-2022 digital assets, embedding legally binding irrevocable debt assignment clauses, 64-character GST IRN hashes, and 8-digit HSN codes into on-chain metadata.\n  - **Gemini Credit Oracle Attestation (`verify_oracle_evaluation`)**: Verifies authorized Ed25519 cryptographic signatures emitted by the AI oracle before promoting an invoice from `Draft` to `Verified`.\n  - **Enterprise Buyer Attestation (`buyer_attest_invoice`)**: Enables enterprise buyers to co-sign the invoice PDA with their corporate keypair, automatically reducing the MSME\'s financing discount rate by 200 bps.\n  - **Multi-Tranche Disbursal (`fund_invoice_tranches`)**: Programs a capital waterfall dividing liquidity between Senior (80%, capital-protected) and Junior (20%, first-loss absorption) tranches.\n  - **Early Settlement Rebate (`settle_invoice`)**: Implements automated pro-rata cash rebates for enterprise buyers who settle prior to maturity, deducting savings directly upon smart contract repayment.\n  - **Default Trigger & Clawback (`trigger_invoice_default`)**: Enforces a strict 15-day post-maturity grace period. Liquidates staked seller collateral for recourse factoring or activates junior first-loss absorption and the protocol reserve PDA for non-recourse factoring.\n\n- **Gemini Multimodal Credit Oracle (`@google/genai`)**:\n  - Implements a server-side audit pipeline analyzing multi-page Indian e-way bills, GSTR-1/3B tax compliance records, and enterprise purchase orders.\n  - Enforces a structured JSON output schema producing authenticity scores, risk tiers, recommended discount rates, and underwriting flags.\n  - Cryptographically signs the canonical audit payload using an Ed25519 keypair for Solana on-chain verification.\n\n- **Swiss Design Interface**:\n  - **Asymmetric Mathematical Grid**: Flush-left, ragged-right typography paired with high-contrast monochrome palettes (off-whites `#F4F4F5`, deep blacks `#0A0A0A`, and deliberate status indicators).\n  - **Overview & Working Capital Simulator**: Live cashflow compression calculator comparing traditional 90-day factoring delays against same-day Solana liquidity.\n  - **Invoice Exchange & Token-2022 Inspector**: Interactive table with real-time state transitions, filter matrix, and tokenization modal.\n  - **Tranche Vaults**: Senior (11.5% APY) and Junior (24.0% APY) pool inspector with simulated SPL LP token minting and sector-specific auto-diversification clusters (Pune Auto Ancillaries, Surat Textiles, Noida Electronics).\n  - **Enterprise Attestation Console**: Dynamic early payment rebate calculator and keypair co-signing simulator.\n  - **TReDS Depository & Webhook Telemetry**: Standardized JSON payloads for RBI-approved TReDS exchanges (RXIL, M1xchange, Invoicemart) to prevent double-factoring, alongside an HMAC-signed ERP webhook dispatcher.\n  - **Anchor Rust Specification**: Tabbed in-browser source code viewer for `lib.rs`, `state.rs`, `errors.rs`, and client integration flows."
    modified_response: "I have implemented **Credexa**, a decentralized invoice discounting and supply chain financing protocol on Solana designed to resolve the 90\342\200\223120 day enterprise payment delay crisis for Indian MSMEs.\n\n### Architecture & Functional Scope\n\n- **Solana Smart Contract Architecture (Anchor Framework)**:\n  - **Invoice Tokenization (`tokenize_invoice`)**: Mints verified receivables as SPL Token-2022 digital assets, embedding legally binding irrevocable debt assignment clauses, 64-character GST IRN hashes, and 8-digit HSN codes into on-chain metadata.\n  - **Gemini Credit Oracle Attestation (`verify_oracle_evaluation`)**: Verifies authorized Ed25519 cryptographic signatures emitted by the AI oracle before promoting an invoice from `Draft` to `Verified`.\n  - **Enterprise Buyer Attestation (`buyer_attest_invoice`)**: Enables enterprise buyers to co-sign the invoice PDA with their corporate keypair, automatically reducing the MSME\'s financing discount rate by 200 bps.\n  - **Multi-Tranche Disbursal (`fund_invoice_tranches`)**: Programs a capital waterfall dividing liquidity between Senior (80%, capital-protected) and Junior (20%, first-loss absorption) tranches.\n  - **Early Settlement Rebate (`settle_invoice`)**: Implements automated pro-rata cash rebates for enterprise buyers who settle prior to maturity, deducting savings directly upon smart contract repayment.\n  - **Default Trigger & Clawback (`trigger_invoice_default`)**: Enforces a strict 15-day post-maturity grace period. Liquidates staked seller collateral for recourse factoring or activates junior first-loss absorption and the protocol reserve PDA for non-recourse factoring.\n\n- **Gemini Multimodal Credit Oracle (`@google/genai`)**:\n  - Implements a server-side audit pipeline analyzing multi-page Indian e-way bills, GSTR-1/3B tax compliance records, and enterprise purchase orders.\n  - Enforces a structured JSON output schema producing authenticity scores, risk tiers, recommended discount rates, and underwriting flags.\n  - Cryptographically signs the canonical audit payload using an Ed25519 keypair for Solana on-chain verification.\n\n- **Swiss Design Interface**:\n  - **Asymmetric Mathematical Grid**: Flush-left, ragged-right typography paired with high-contrast monochrome palettes (off-whites `#F4F4F5`, deep blacks `#0A0A0A`, and deliberate status indicators).\n  - **Overview & Working Capital Simulator**: Live cashflow compression calculator comparing traditional 90-day factoring delays against same-day Solana liquidity.\n  - **Invoice Exchange & Token-2022 Inspector**: Interactive table with real-time state transitions, filter matrix, and tokenization modal.\n  - **Tranche Vaults**: Senior (11.5% APY) and Junior (24.0% APY) pool inspector with simulated SPL LP token minting and sector-specific auto-diversification clusters (Pune Auto Ancillaries, Surat Textiles, Noida Electronics).\n  - **Enterprise Attestation Console**: Dynamic early payment rebate calculator and keypair co-signing simulator.\n  - **TReDS Depository & Webhook Telemetry**: Standardized JSON payloads for RBI-approved TReDS exchanges (RXIL, M1xchange, Invoicemart) to prevent double-factoring, alongside an HMAC-signed ERP webhook dispatcher.\n  - **Anchor Rust Specification**: Tabbed in-browser source code viewer for `lib.rs`, `state.rs`, `errors.rs`, and client integration flows."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
